<title>GUADELOUPE: Port conditions update - Guadeloupe - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Guadeloupe - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>GUADELOUPE, Dec 2 - Strike at Pointe a Pitre - Workers at handling firm GSP, a subsidiary company of CGM, have been on a go-slow strike since Nov 21. The CGT union is leading the strike.</p>
